2026-06-27 23:48:34,773 | AGENT | AIInnovation Agent answered: Based on our company context at Faber IA, we propose an AI solution that leverages our Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) capabilities to assist hospital staff in their daily activities. Our approach will focus on providing explainable recommendations and supporting medical coding for activity reporting.

The proposed AI components include:

1. Hybrid retrieval: This component will enable the retrieval of relevant information from internal procedures, care protocols, and applicable regulatory texts to support staff in their decision-making.
